{"id":15287,"author":"Milki","body":"This is my first video of osu! gameplay, enjoy ^_^\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Z3uSsvGT84\" title=\"Link: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Z3uSsvGT84\"\u003ehttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Z3uSsvGT84\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003emashmashmashmash\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePlayer: MilkFreedom \u003ca href=\"http://www.osu.ppy.sh/u/milkfreedom\" title=\"Link: http://www.osu.ppy.sh/u/milkfreedom\"\u003ehttp://www.osu.ppy.sh/u/milkfreedom\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMap: LeaF- MEPHISTO\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://osu.ppy.sh/p/beatmap?b=282166\u0026amp;m=0\" title=\"Link: https://osu.ppy.sh/p/beatmap?b=282166\u0026amp;m=0\"\u003ehttps://osu.ppy.sh/p/beatmap?b=282166\u0026amp;m=0\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eStyle: Keyboard+Tablet (Laptop Keyboard and Wacom Bamboo CTL-470)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eQ+A:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQ: What is osu? A:\u0026nbsp;osu! is a free rhythm game about clicking circles. Find more about it at \u003ca href=\"osu.ppy.sh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eosu.ppy.sh\u003c/a\u003e!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQ: I play osu!, is there a group of people on Avicus that I could join? A: Yes! We have an Avicus osu! Skype group. Just add me on Skype (My handle is milkcreamyum) and say that you are from Avicus and would like to join the Avicus osu! group.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(Yes, I know quality isn't very good. Please suggest\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003efree\u003c/b\u003e and good recording software. I'm currently using XSplit, if that helps you.)","body_tagged":"This is my first video of osu! gameplay, enjoy ^_^\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Z3uSsvGT84\" title=\"Link: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Z3uSsvGT84\"\u003ehttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Z3uSsvGT84\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003emashmashmashmash\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePlayer: MilkFreedom \u003ca href=\"http://www.osu.ppy.sh/u/milkfreedom\" title=\"Link: http://www.osu.ppy.sh/u/milkfreedom\"\u003ehttp://www.osu.ppy.sh/u/milkfreedom\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eMap: LeaF- MEPHISTO\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://osu.ppy.sh/p/beatmap?b=282166\u0026amp;m=0\" title=\"Link: https://osu.ppy.sh/p/beatmap?b=282166\u0026amp;m=0\"\u003ehttps://osu.ppy.sh/p/beatmap?b=282166\u0026amp;m=0\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eStyle: Keyboard+Tablet (Laptop Keyboard and Wacom Bamboo CTL-470)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eQ+A:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQ: What is osu? A:\u0026nbsp;osu! is a free rhythm game about clicking circles. Find more about it at \u003ca href=\"osu.ppy.sh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eosu.ppy.sh\u003c/a\u003e!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQ: I play osu!, is there a group of people on Avicus that I could join? A: Yes! We have an Avicus osu! Skype group. Just add me on Skype (My handle is milkcreamyum) and say that you are from Avicus and would like to join the Avicus osu! group.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(Yes, I know quality isn't very good. Please suggest\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003efree\u003c/b\u003e and good recording software. I'm currently using XSplit, if that helps you.)","created_at":1437912704,"title":"[osu!] LeaF-MEPHISTO","replies":[{"id":211738,"author":"Eteh","body":"I'm sure non-Avicus related video content is not allowed on the forums.","body_tagged":"I'm sure non-Avicus related video content is not allowed on the forums.","created_at":1437913120},{"id":211740,"author":"Milki","body":"@et477 Nope, under Forum Rules, rule 5, it's only non-Avicus\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eMinecraft servers\u003c/b\u003e.","body_tagged":"@et477 Nope, under Forum Rules, rule 5, it's only non-Avicus\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eMinecraft servers\u003c/b\u003e.","created_at":1437913504},{"id":211741,"author":"vladthegreat100","body":"It is as long as it's not advertising any other minecraft server, it's not attacking Avicus in any way or if the content is too inappropriate.","body_tagged":"It is as long as it's not advertising any other minecraft server, it's not attacking Avicus in any way or if the content is too inappropriate.","created_at":1437913666,"reply_to":211738},{"id":211815,"author":"TheColdCrafter","body":"As long as it isn't advertising any other server, it's fine.","body_tagged":"As long as it isn't advertising any other server, it's fine.","created_at":1437929796},{"id":211850,"author":"Emmaye","body":"Nice vid!","body_tagged":"Nice vid!","created_at":1437938621},{"id":211926,"author":"Milki","body":"Thank you!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIMO that was just an okay run for me; I'll try to get better quality from XSplit next time, and maybe some harder song as well, and next video you'll see exactly when I hit my keys!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBut yeah, the question still stands:\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eDoes anyone know of a good free game recorder\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e?\u003c/b\u003e It cannot be Fraps or OBS, sorry for the people who like those. (Fraps isn't good since I need more than 30 seconds, and OBS doesn't work for me.)","body_tagged":"Thank you!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIMO that was just an okay run for me; I'll try to get better quality from XSplit next time, and maybe some harder song as well, and next video you'll see exactly when I hit my keys!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBut yeah, the question still stands:\u0026nbsp;\u003cb\u003eDoes anyone know of a good free game recorder\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb\u003e?\u003c/b\u003e It cannot be Fraps or OBS, sorry for the people who like those. (Fraps isn't good since I need more than 30 seconds, and OBS doesn't work for me.)","created_at":1437950082,"reply_to":211850},{"id":211929,"author":"Emmaye","body":"I don't really now any good recorders for free unless you crack one, like Fraps. But be careful with cracking that type of stuff, some sites have some pretty brutal viruses and adware on it.","body_tagged":"I don't really now any good recorders for free unless you crack one, like Fraps. But be careful with cracking that type of stuff, some sites have some pretty brutal viruses and adware on it.","created_at":1437950568,"reply_to":211926},{"id":211931,"author":"RefuseToSink","body":"Camtasia is pretty decent, there's a way where you can reset the 30 day free trial by just deleting a document.","body_tagged":"Camtasia is pretty decent, there's a way where you can reset the 30 day free trial by just deleting a document.","created_at":1437950677,"reply_to":211926},{"id":211938,"author":"TheTNTPotato","body":"Brb SSing it :D\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNoice though o/ Must have another Saturday night match though! \\(^-^)/","body_tagged":"Brb SSing it :D\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNoice though o/ Must have another Saturday night match though! \\(^-^)/","created_at":1437951874},{"id":211948,"author":"Emmaye","body":"It's good, but the quality can be a little weird with 480p being the highest from what I've experienced.","body_tagged":"It's good, but the quality can be a little weird with 480p being the highest from what I've experienced.","created_at":1437954084,"reply_to":211931},{"id":211949,"author":"RefuseToSink","body":"That's weird, I get 720p :p","body_tagged":"That's weird, I get 720p :p","created_at":1437954233,"reply_to":211948},{"id":211950,"author":"Emmaye","body":"Lucky :c","body_tagged":"Lucky :c","created_at":1437954703,"reply_to":211949},{"id":211954,"author":"MLGtino","body":"CHALLENGE ACCEPTED\u0026nbsp;( ͡°( ͡° ͜ʖ( ͡° ͜ʖ ͡°)ʖ ͡°) ͡°)","body_tagged":"CHALLENGE ACCEPTED\u0026nbsp;( ͡°( ͡° ͜ʖ( ͡° ͜ʖ ͡°)ʖ ͡°) ͡°)","created_at":1437955100},{"id":211958,"author":"Milki","body":"wait but i thought you were noob streamer :^)","body_tagged":"wait but i thought you were noob streamer :^)","created_at":1437955801,"reply_to":211938},{"id":211960,"author":"Klondichael","body":"Osu noob","body_tagged":"Osu noob","created_at":1437956062},{"id":211990,"author":"TheColdCrafter","body":"Beat whos afraid of the big black\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Roboto-